<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Avon Crowncaps 96 net higher.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Avon Crowncaps 96 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result to end-March 1996 for Avon Crowncaps Nigeria Plc. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,600    vs 1,500</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   135    vs   141.3</p>
<p> Taxation			11.6  vs    47.7</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    123.5  vs    93.6</p>
<p>NOTE - It is proposing a dividend of 17.5 kobo per share and a one-for-four scrip issue. Closure of register: Nov 22 - Nov 27, 1996.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
